          "Good data elements read from a standardised data layer, are reused across rules, return safe defaults instead of null or undefined, and are documented with an owner and definition. In single-page apps, update the data layer first and then fire a custom event so rules read fresh values. Changes are versioned and tested so one team cannot break another.",
